    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.windmill.name=Windmill
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.windmill.tooltip=Machine Type: §eWindmill, Macerator§r\nA primitive Grinder powered by §bKinetic Energy\nMacerates up to§6 16 §7items at a time\nThe amount of parallels is determined by §bWind Speed\nParallels determine how many items are processed per recipe\nProcessing time is the same regardless of parallels\n§bWind Speed §7can be determined using the §eSimple Wind Meter\nRotor can be put in the §9Primitive Kinetic Shaftbox\nWill not work if wind is non-existent or too strong\n§c12.5% §7speed\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§62§7 parallels: §fLow\n§64§7 parallels: §2Common\n§68§7 parallels: §6Rather strong\n§616§7 parallels: §4Very Strong\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.windmill.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §67§7x§67§7x§612§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §644 §fBricks\n   §640-47 §fTerracotta\n   §6100 §fWooden Planks (any)\n   §61 §fPrimitive Kinetic Shaftbox\n   §fDispenser: §7Any Terracotta\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.chemicalplant.controller.tier.single.name=ExxonMobil Chemical Plant
    S:gt.blockmachines.chemicalplant.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eChemical Plant§r\nHeavy Industry, now right at your doorstep!\nPlant tier is determined by casing tier\nHatch tiers can't be higher than machine casing tier, UHV casing unlocks all tiers\n§62§7 Parallels per §fPipe Casing§7 Tier\n+20% chance of not damaging catalyst per §f§fPipe Casing§7§7 Tier\nSpeed is §a50%§7 times §fHeating Coil§7 Tier\nAny catalyst must be placed in the catalyst housing\nAwakened Draconium Coils combined with Tungstensteel Pipe Casings makes catalyst unbreakable\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.chemicalplant.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §67§7x§67§7x§67§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §670-91 §fMetal Machine Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §657 §fMachine Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §627 §fHeating Coil §b(Tiered)\n   §618 §fPipe Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §e0-1 §fCatalyst Housing: §7Any metal machine casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any metal machine casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any metal machine casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus/Hatch: §7Any metal machine casing\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus/Hatch: §7Any metal machine casing\n   \nSubchannel §bcasing§7 determines §bMetal Machine Casing Tier\nSubchannel §bmachine_casing§7 determines §bMachine Casing Tier\nSubchannel §bcoil§7 determines §bHeating Coil Tier\nSubchannel §bpipe§7 determines §bPipe Casing Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
