    S:gt.blockmachines.largefusioncomputer5.tooltip=Machine Type: §eFusion Reactor§r\nGalaxy Collapse\n§b83,886,080§7 EU/t and §b640M§7 EU capacity per Energy Hatch\nIf the recipe has a startup cost greater than the\nnumber of energy hatches * cap, you can't do it\nIf the recipe requires a voltage tier over §5§nUEV§r§7 , you can't do it either\nPerforms 4/4 overclock\nHas §f(1 + §dMachine Tier§f - §aRecipe Tier§f) * 64§6 Parallels\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
