    S:gt.blockmachines.lftr.controller.single.name=Thorium Reactor [LFTR]
    S:gt.blockmachines.lftr.controller.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eReactor§r\nController Block for the Liquid Fluoride Thorium Reactor\nProduces energy and new elements from Radioactive Beta Decay!\nInput LFTB and a molten salt as fuel, and match the four 4A dynamo hatches:\nLFTR Fuel 1 (4 EV Hatches), LFTR Fuel 2 (4 IV Hatches), LFTR Fuel 3 (4 LuV Hatches)\nIf using better hatches for a worse fuel, only 1 hatch outputs EU\nOutputs U-233 every 10 seconds, on average, while the reactor is running\nCheck NEI to see the other 3 outputs - they differ between fuels\n§54000 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.lftr.controller.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §67§7x§67§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §627-86 §fHastelloy-N Reactor Casing\n   §626 §fReactor Shield Casing\n   §e4 §fDynamo Hatch: §7Any edge casing (EV-LuV)\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any edge casing\n   §e4 §fMuffler Hatch: §7Any top 3x3 center casing (IV+)\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any edge casing (IV+)\n   §e4+ §fOutput Hatch: §7Any edge casing (IV+)\n   §fMandatory Air: §7Interior of the structure\n   \n§cDynamo cannot be greater than 4A\nOne ME output hatch can replace the four regular output hatches\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
