    S:gt.blockmachines.megablastfurnace.name=Mega Electric Blast Furnace
    S:gt.blockmachines.megablastfurnace.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBlast Furnace, MEBF, MBF§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§b-5%§7 EU Usage per §c900K§7 above the recipe requirement\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nIncreases Heat by §c100K§7 for every §fVoltage§7 tier past §bMV\nEvery §c1800K§7 over the recipe requirement grants 1 §dPerfect Overclock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§2§nUV§7-tier §fGlass§7 required for Laser Hatches\nEnergy Hatch limited by §fGlass§7 Tier\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§5102400 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.megablastfurnace.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §615§7x§615§7x§620§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 3rd layer\n   §60-447 §fHeat Proof Machine Casing\n   §6864 §fHeating Coil §b(Tiered)\n   §61007 §fAny Tiered Glass §b(Tiered)\n   The glass tier limits the Energy Input tier\n   §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fMuffler Hatch: §7Top middle\n   §fInput Bus: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fInput Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fOutput Bus: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fOutput Hatch: §7Any Heat Proof Machine Casing\nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\nSubchannel §bcoil§7 determines §bHeating Coil Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.megachemicalreactor.name=Mega Chemical Reactor
    S:gt.blockmachines.megachemicalreactor.tooltip=Machine Type: §eChemical Reactor, MCR§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\n§8§o"What molecule do you want to synthesize?"§r§7\n§8§o"Or do you want to replace something in this molecule?"§r§7\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§bMachine does not lose efficiency when overclocked\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§2§nUV§7-tier §fGlass§7 required for Laser Hatches\nEnergy Hatch limited by §fGlass§7 Tier\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.megachemicalreactor.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §69§7x§65§7x§65§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center\n   §646+ §fChemically Inert Machine Casing\n   §67 §fFusion Coil Block\n   §628 §fPTFE Pipe Casing\n   §664 §fAny Tiered Glass §b(Tiered)\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Hint block \n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Hint block \n§f   Input Hatch: §7Hint block \n§f   Input Bus: §7Hint block \n§f   Output Bus: §7Hint block \n§f   Output Hatch: §7Hint block \nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.megadistillationtower.name=Mega Distillation Tower
    S:gt.blockmachines.megadistillationtower.tooltip=Machine Type: §eMDT§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nFluids are only put out at the correct height\nThe correct height equals the slot number in the NEI recipe\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.megadistillationtower.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §615§7x§615§7x§616-56§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §fClean Stainless Steel Machine Casing: §715 x h - 5 (minimum)\n   §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any Casing\n   §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any Casing\n   §fInput Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fOutput Bus: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n   §fOutput Hatch: §72-11x Output Hatches (One per Output Layer except bottom layer)\n   An "Output Layer" consists of 5 layers!\nSubchannel §bheight§7 determines §bStructure Height\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.megaoilcracker.name=Mega Oil Cracker
    S:gt.blockmachines.megaoilcracker.tooltip=Machine Type: §eCracker, MOC§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\n§8§o"Thermally cracks heavy hydrocarbons into lighter fractions"§r§7\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§b-10%§7 EU Usage per §f§fHeating Coil§7§7 Tier\nup to a maximum of §b-50%§7 EU Usage\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nGives different benefits whether it hydro or steam-cracks:\nHydro - Consumes §320%§7 less Hydrogen and outputs §325%§7 more cracked fluid\nSteam - Outputs §350%§7 more cracked fluid\n§oIn comparison to a chemical reactor§r\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§2§nUV§7-tier §fGlass§7 required for Laser Hatches\nEnergy Hatch limited by §fGlass§7 Tier\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.megaoilcracker.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §69§7x§613§7x§67§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §6197 §fClean Stainless Steel Machine Casing\n   §692 §fCoil §b(Tiered)\n   §6196 §fAny Tiered Glass §b(Tiered)\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Hint block\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Hint block\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Hint block\n§f   Output Hatch: §7Hint block\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Steam/Hydrogen ONLY, Hint block\n§f   Input Bus: §7Optional, for programmed circuit automation. Hint block\nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\nSubchannel §bcoil§7 determines §bHeating Coil Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.megavacuumfreezer.name=Mega Vacuum Freezer
    S:gt.blockmachines.megavacuumfreezer.tooltip=Machine Type: §eVacuum Freezer, MVF§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\n§8§o"Handles all things cooling!"§r§7\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nUpgrade to Tier 2 to unlock §3Subspace Cooling.\nWill gain §6perfect overclocks §7by §aconsuming §dcoolants:\n§a75 L/s§7 : §61 §7: §dMolten Spacetime\n§a50 L/s§7 : §62 §7: §dSpatially Enlarged Fluid\n§a25 L/s§7 : §63 §7: §dMolten Eternity\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§3Reinforcing the structure allows the injection of exotic coolants,\n§3enabling the capture of heat energy from miniature tears in spacetime,\n§3massively increasing the efficiency of the cooling process.\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.megavacuumfreezer.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §615§7x§615§7x§615§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any Frost Proof Machine Casing\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any Frost Proof Machine Casing\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Any Frost Proof Machine Casing\n§f   Output Hatch: §7Any Frost Proof Machine Casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Frost Proof Machine Casing\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Frost Proof Machine Casing\n   §9Base Multi (Tier §51§9):\n   §6800 §7Frost Proof Machine Casing (Minimum)\n   §9Tier §52§9 (Upgrades from Tier §51§9):\n   §6700 §7Frost Proof Machine Casing (Minimum)\n   §6384 §7Infinity Cooled Casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
