    S:gt.blockmachines.nag.tooltip=Machine Type: §eNaquadah Reactor, LNR§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nEnvironmentally Friendly!\nGenerate power from high-energy liquids\nConsumes §b2400 L/s Liquid Air§7 to keep running, otherwise§e it will void your fuel§7.\nThe reactor will explode when there is more than§c ONE§7 type of fuel in hatches!\nInput liquid nuclear fuel or liquid naquadah fuel\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nCan increase §defficiency §7by §fconsuming §9coolants:\n§f1000 L/s§7 : §d105% §7: §9IC2 Coolant\n§f1000 L/s§7 : §d150% §7: §9Super Coolant\n§f1000 L/s§7 : §d275% §7: §9Cryotheum\n§f20 L/s§7 : §d500% §7: §9Tachyon Rich Temporal Fluid\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nCan increase §doutput power and fuel usage §7by §fconsuming §cexcited liquid:\n§f180 L/s §7: §d2x power §7: §cMolten Caesium\n§f180 L/s §7: §d3x power §7: §cMolten Uranium-235\n§f20 L/s §7: §d4x power §7: §cMolten Naquadah\n§f20 L/s §7: §d16x power §7: §cMolten Atomic Separation Catalyst\n§f20 L/s §7: §d64x power §7: §cSpatially Enlarged Fluid\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
