    S:gt.blockmachines.planetarygassiphon.name=Planetary Gas Siphon
    S:gt.blockmachines.planetarygassiphon.tooltip=Machine Type: §ePump, PGS§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\n§o%s\nBuild on a Space Station orbiting a Gas Planet\nRequires a Programmed Circuit set to the depth you want to pump from (1 - 4)\nRequires 64x depth Mining Pipes\nPower cost depends on planet tier and depth. See NEI page for more details.\nCan load the chunk it is in (toggle using a Soldering Iron)\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.planetarygassiphon.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§67§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §fPlanetary Siphon Casing: §73x1x3 base (hollow), needs §63§7\n   §fRebolted Rhodium-Plated Palladium Casing: §71x4x1 pillar in the middle\n   §fTungstensteel Frame Box: §7Each pillar's side and 1x3x1 on top\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any siphon casing\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any siphon casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any siphon casing\n§f   Output Hatch: §7Any siphon casing\n   Must have exactly §61§7 of each hatch!\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
